  "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xz$-plane, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the ellipsoid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{{0}^{2}}{2}+{z}^{2} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{16}+{z}^{2} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{{4}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{1}^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of the ellipse with semi-axes $4$ and $1,$ centered at $(3,0)$ in the $xz$-plane.",
